                <pb facs="0269" n="1003" sameAs="frus:frus1895p2/pg1003"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 2 in No. 40—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Article</hi> 185.</p>
                <p>In regard to continuous offenses, the commission of which was previously begun in
                    a foreign country and continues in the Republic, the offenders, whether Mexicans
                    or foreigners, shall be punished in accordance with the laws thereof.</p>
            </div>
